yt-dlp
https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp

Fastpotify may embed one official yt-dlp executable per release target.
The pin (tag and SHA-256) lives in `manifest` in this directory. Vendor
scripts download that file only from the official GitHub release and
verify it against both the pin and upstream SHA2-256SUMS. Fastpotify
does not download yt-dlp at runtime. A user-installed yt-dlp is used
only when its version is strictly newer than the pinned build.

